      "start": 0.10,
      "end": 4.65,
      "text": "In movies, soldiers pull a grenade pin with their teeth—that would rip your teeth out, and it doesn't even start the timer!"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "beatId": "B2",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "start": 4.85,
      "end": 9.65,
      "text": "Watch what happens the second he throws it—inside, a coiled steel spring is locked down by this curved spoon."
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "beatId": "B3",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "start": 9.90,
      "end": 14.65,
      "text": "The instant it leaves his hand, the spoon flies off—and a steel striker hammer slams into the brass primer!"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "beatId": "B4",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "start": 14.85,
      "end": 20.45,
      "text": "That spark lights a four-second delay fuse—burning steadily down the center as it flies toward the enemy bunker!"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "beatId": "B5",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "start": 20.70,
      "end": 25.35,
      "text": "The moment it lands by the sandbags, the flame hits the core—and superheated gas swells to extreme pressure!"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "beatId": "B6",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "start": 25.55,
      "end": 29.70,
      "text": "In a millisecond, the pre-scored cast-iron shell shatters outward in a massive shockwave!"
